---
// Contact and main inquiry route. Copy: advisory_based_specs/02_Replacement_Copy.md §14.
// Inquiries go by email only. MailerLite is not used for inquiries. Clicking the email button fires "inquiry_email_click", which only
// means the link was clicked; it does not mean a message was sent.
// No reply time is promised until one can be met.
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Kicker from '../components/content/Kicker.astro';
import { EMAIL, INQUIRY_MAILTO } from '../lib/routes';

const title = 'Tell me what you need help with | PainToBuild';
const description = 'Send a short message about your idea or product, what you have tried and where you need help. I will let you know whether a review could help.';
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} ogImagePath="/open-graph/contact.png">
  <section class="wrap section prose">
    <Kicker>Contact</Kicker>
    <h1>Tell me what you need help with</h1>
    <p class="lede">
      Email <a href={`mailto:${EMAIL}`}>{EMAIL}</a> with a short description of your idea or
      product and where you are stuck.
    </p>

    <h2>What to include</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>What you are building or thinking about.</li>
      <li>A public link, if you have one.</li>
      <li>The decision you need to make.</li>
      <li>What you have tried and what happened.</li>
      <li>Any limits on your time or budget.</li>
    </ul>
    <p class="panel">
      A summary is enough to start. Do not send passwords or private customer records. If I need
      more detail, I will explain what to share and how it will be handled.
    </p>

    <h2>What happens next</h2>
    <p>
      I will read your message and ask any questions needed to decide whether I can help. If the
      work is a good fit, you and I agree on the price, timing and what the review covers.
    </p>
    <p>Sending a message does not book a service or commit you to paying.</p>
    <div class="email-box">
      <a class="btn btn-primary" href={INQUIRY_MAILTO}
         data-event="inquiry_email_click" data-event-page="/contact/" data-event-cta-id="contact-email">
        Email me
      </a>
      <p class="address">{EMAIL}</p>
    </div>

    <h2>Questions about a guide or article</h2>
    <p>
      You can use the same address for download problems or corrections to an article. Include the
      product name or page link and explain what needs attention.
    </p>
    <ul class="link-list">
      <li><a href="/advisory/">What the review includes</a></li>
      <li><a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a></li>
      <li><a href="/terms/">Terms</a></li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .section { padding-block: var(--s7) var(--s8); }
  .email-box { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: var(--s3) var(--s5); margin: var(--s5) 0; }
  .address { margin: 0 !important; font-weight: 700; user-select: all; overflow-wrap: anywhere; }
</style>
